schema: "0.4"
id: npl-nocturne-20-sessions-list
type: image
quality: high

# NoizuPromptLingo (a prompt-definition language + MCP toolchain for agent engineers) — Sessions List screen.
# Theme tenets: dark-native near-black canvas, single phosphor-green "live" signal, mono-first, 4px radius, flat surface-step elevation (no glow/gradient).
# Palette: canvas #010409, panel #0d1117, raised #161b22, text #e6edf3, secondary #909dab, signal green #3fb950, link cyan #58a6ff, amber #d29922.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of a
    dark-native agent-engineering instrument — calm, dense, expert, the kind of
    tool you live in inside a terminal with the lights off. Cool terminal dark
    throughout; the ONLY saturated color is a single phosphor-green "live" signal.
    Monospace is a co-equal voice (IDs, timestamps, project slugs render mono).
    Flat surfaces separated by lightness steps, never drop shadows or glow.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity UI mockup of the Sessions List screen of NoizuPromptLingo,
    a prompt-definition language and MCP toolchain for agent engineers.

    OVERALL LAYOUT (two bands): a slim LEFT NAV RAIL on the darkest near-black
    canvas tone ("the rack" — icon + label items, one active item marked only by a
    2px phosphor-green left rail and slightly brighter text, no filled highlight),
    and a CONTENT AREA on a one-step-lighter dark panel tone ("the instrument").

    HEADER BAND (top of content): the page title "Sessions" in soft off-white
    sans-serif, a muted one-line subtitle, and a right-aligned primary CREATE
    SESSION button — a solid phosphor-green fill with near-black label, 4px radius,
    the single lit control on the screen.

    STATUS FILTER CHIPS: a row of small rounded chips — "Active", "Paused",
    "Completed" — the selected chip carrying a quiet green outline, the rest low
    dark-bordered ghosts on the panel.

    SESSION TABLE (the dominant region): a dense data table, quiet dark hairline
    row separators, a faint raised header row with medium-weight muted labels
    "Status · Title · Project · Last active". ~8 rows. Each row: a small STATUS DOT
    (one or two rows show a lit phosphor-green "active" dot; others a muted grey
    "paused"/"completed" dot), a session title in off-white, a mono PROJECT SLUG
    chip (monospace, tonal pill), and a right-aligned mono relative timestamp
    ("2m ago", "1h ago"). One active row carries a 2px phosphor-green left edge.

    PALETTE & TYPE: cool near-black canvas and a slightly lighter dark panel; soft
    off-white primary text, cool grey secondary text; phosphor-green reserved
    strictly for the create button, the active status dots, the selected filter,
    and the one live row edge. Inter for UI text; JetBrains Mono for IDs, slugs,
    and timestamps — mono is prominent, not hidden.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: 4px radius on the button, chips, and cards; flat fills with
    elevation read from surface lightness steps, not shadows; low-contrast dark
    borders. No gradients, no glow, no scanlines.

    MOOD: focused, immersive, low-noise high-signal — the lights are off and the
    work is on. Green means live.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI, neon glow, bloom, CRT scanlines, gradient background, pure-black OLED background, pure-white surfaces"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Matches the Sessions List layout: nav rail, header with Create Session, status filter chips, and a dense session table with status/title/project/last-active columns"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Dark-native canvas, single phosphor-green signal used sparingly, mono IDs/slugs/timestamps, 4px radius, flat surface-step elevation — not generic UI defaults, no glow/gradient"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Clear visual hierarchy, plausible real dashboard layout, comfortable density"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "neon glow, bloom, or gradient wash (breaks the flat dark instrument register)"

tags: [npl-nocturne, NoizuPromptLingo, screen-mockup]
